OL,3,AWeapon or wine bottle? China disputes
OL,4,Areports of artillery shell in Papua New
OL,5,AGuinea
OL,6,
OL,7,FChinese authorities have dismissed
OL,8,Freports that a suspected China-made
OL,9,Fartillery shell was found in a
OL,10,Fcommercial shipping container in Papua
OL,11,FNew Guinea, saying it is a
OL,12,F"shell-shaped wine bottle".
OL,14,F"It poses no danger at all," the
OL,15,FChinese embassy wrote in a Facebook
OL,16,Fpost on Tuesday, drawing sceptical
OL,17,Fcomments.
OL,19,FPolice in Port Moresby arrested four
OL,20,FChinese nationals last Friday after the
OL,21,F32kg object was found at a construction
OL,22,Fsite in the capital city.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
