OL,5,AGuinea
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities were looking into whether
OL,8,Fit was a live device, local reports
OL,9,Fsaid then, with police commissioner
OL,10,FDavid Manning describing it as "a very
OL,11,Fconcerning discovery".
